OL,3,ATwo children among eight killed in
OL,4,A'devastating' New York building
OL,5,Acollapse, mayor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix adults and two children have been
OL,8,Fkilled after a three-storey building
OL,9,Fcollapsed in New York, mayor Zohran
OL,10,FMamdani says
OL,12,FTwo of the dead were construction
OL,13,Fworkers. A further 18 people were
OL,14,Finjured, four of whom are firefighters
OL,15,F- see the scene before and after the
OL,16,Fincident
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
