OL,3,ATwo children among eight killed in
OL,4,A'devastating' New York building
OL,5,Acollapse, mayor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FFirefighters arrived on the scene of
OL,8,Fthe "devastating" incident in less than
OL,9,Fone minute, Mamdani says, as he calls
OL,10,Ffor a "comprehensive and thorough"
OL,11,Finvestigation into why the building
OL,12,Fcollapsed
OL,14,FA search and rescue operation continues
OL,15,F- an official says: "We always assume
OL,16,Fthere are more people there until we
OL,17,Fcan access the ground"
